{"content":"Consider the reaction sequence given below:\n<picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukey64syb/64ea7b9f-d745-46e4-8b38-868245fd3e1d/7e143e30-f423-11ea-8293-3b6cc591631c/file-jgy2xukey64syc-320w.jpg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukey64syb/64ea7b9f-d745-46e4-8b38-868245fd3e1d/7e143e30-f423-11ea-8293-3b6cc591631c/file-jgy2xukey64syc-500w.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Evening Slot Chemistry - Haloalkanes and Haloarenes Question 133 English\"></picture>\n<br>Which of the following statements is true?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Changing the concentration of base will\nhave no effect on reaction (1)"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Changing the concentration of base will\nhave no effect on reaction (2)"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Changing the base from OH<sup>-</sup> to <sup>-</sup>OR will\nhave no effect on reaction (2)"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Doubling the concentration of base will\ndouble the rate of both the reactions"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"For reaction 1,\n<br>rate = K [t-BuBr] ....(1)\n<br><br>for reaction 2,\n<br>rate = K[t-BuBr][OH<sup>–</sup>] ...(2)\n<br><br>Reaction 1 is independent of concentration of\nOH<sup>–</sup> where as reaction 2 is dependent on\nconcentration of OH<sup>–</sup>\n<br><br>Hence changing the concentration of base will\nhave no effect on reaction 1."},"hi":{"content":"नीचे दिए गए प्रतिक्रिया क्रम पर विचार करें:\n<picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukey64syb/64ea7b9f-d745-46e4-8b38-868245fd3e1d/7e143e30-f423-11ea-8293-3b6cc591631c/file-jgy2xukey64syc-320w.jpg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukey64syb/64ea7b9f-d745-46e4-8b38-868245fd3e1d/7e143e30-f423-11ea-8293-3b6cc591631c/file-jgy2xukey64syc-500w.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Evening Slot Chemistry - Haloalkanes and Haloarenes Question 133 Hindi\"></picture>\n<br>निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा कथन सत्य है?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"प्रतिक्रिया (1) में आधार की सांद्रता बदलने पर\n��ोई प्रभाव नहीं पड़ेगा"},{"identifier":"B","content":"प्रतिक्रिया (2) में आधार की सांद्रता बदलने पर\nकोई प्रभाव नहीं पड़ेगा"},{"identifier":"C","content":"OH<sup>-</sup> से <sup>-</sup>OR में आधार बदलने पर\nप्रतिक्रिया (2) पर कोई प्रभाव नहीं पड़ेगा"},{"identifier":"D","content":"आधार की सांद्रता को दुगना करने से\nदोनों प्रतिक्रियाओं की दर दुगुनी हो जाएगी"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"ihvurbjT88kHKA416Jjgy2xukey69y6l","updated_time":1605083071,"permalink":"consider-the-reaction-sequence-given-below-picturesource-jee-main-chemistry-basics-of-organic-chemistry-5p9c4xnxaaffomxl","topic":"haloalkanes","paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-2nd-september-evening-slot","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-2nd-september-evening-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","chapter":"aldehydes-ketones-and-carboxylic-acids","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Evening Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"medium","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-02 15:00","question":{"en":{"content":"Arrange the following labelled hydrogens in\ndecreasing order of acidity :\n<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukey6w6b1/02c157a6-6b6a-4478-ad77-bf4dc2e2d904/773db9d0-f426-11ea-8293-3b6cc591631c/file-jgy2xukey6w6b2-320w.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2